  <h1>About</h1>
</section>

<div class="about-row">
  <div class="about-body">
    <p>I grew up in Arkansas, which tends to surprise people who've only met the Silicon Valley version of me. I studied business at Arkansas Tech, cut my teeth in category and revenue roles for consumer brands, spent a few years in the New York area, and eventually made my way west after an MBA.</p>
    <p>Somewhere along the way I stopped being content deciding what should get built and got interested in building it myself. That's really what pulled me toward AI — the gap between "here's an idea for a customer" and "here's a working version of it" finally got small enough for a product person to close on their own. I try not to take myself too seriously; if we end up working together, that part tends to show up first.</p>
  </div>
