  <div class="about-body">
    <h2>What I'm working on</h2>
    <p>These days I work on applied AI for Amazon Devices Sustainability. The part I like most is the messy beginning: sitting with a problem someone can't quite put into words and figuring out what's actually worth building. Lately I've been especially curious about AI agents — how much of building, and even running, a small company you might be able to hand to them.</p>
